{"speciesId":314,"names":{"fr":"Lumivole","es":"Illumise","en":"Illumise","ja":"イルミーゼ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ILLUMISE attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT using a sweet fragrance. Once the VOLBEAT have gathered, this POKéMON leads the lit-up swarm in drawing geometric designs on the canvas of the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ILLUMISE leads a flight of illuminated VOLBEAT to draw signs in the night sky. This POKéMON is said to earn greater respect from its peers by composing more complex designs in the sky."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A nocturnal POKéMON that becomes active upon nightfall. It leads a VOLBEAT swarm to draw patterns in the night sky. Over 200 different patterns have been confirmed."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It guides VOLBEAT to draw signs in night skies. There are scientists that study the patterns it creates."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It guides VOLBEAT to draw signs in night skies. There are scientists that study the patterns it creates."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its fragrance attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its fragrance attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise son doux parfum pour aider Muciole à décrire des arabesques dans le ciel nocturne."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise son doux parfum pour aider Muciole à décrire des arabesques dans le ciel nocturne."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il utilise son doux parfum pour aider Muciole à décrire plus de 200 arabesques dans le ciel nocturne."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Con su dulce aroma guía a grupos de Volbeat para que tracen hasta 200 dibujos distintos en el cielo nocturno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its fragrance attracts a swarm of Volbeat, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"甘い 香りで バルビートを 誘導して ２００ 以上の 模様を 夜空に 描く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il utilise son doux parfum pour aider Muciole à décrire des arabesques dans le ciel nocturne."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su suave aroma guía a Volbeat para que haga señales luminosas en el cielo nocturno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"甘い 香りで バルビートを 誘導して 夜空に 光の サインを 描く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lumivole peut attirer un essaim de Muciole grâce à son doux parfum. Une fois les Muciole rassemblés, ce Pokémon dirige cette nuée lumineuse et lui fait dessiner des figures géométriques dans la nuit étoilée."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Illumise atrae mediante su dulce aroma a enjambres de Volbeat. Una vez que los ha agrupado, les guía en el vuelo para que dibujen formas geométricas en el lienzo del oscuro cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Illumise attracts a swarm of Volbeat using a sweet fragrance. Once the Volbeat have gathered, this Pokémon leads the lit-up swarm in drawing geometric designs on the canvas of the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甘い 香りで バルビートを 引き寄せる。 沢山 集まった バルビートを 誘導して 夜空に 幾何学的な 図形を 描くぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lumivole dirige un vol de Muciole lumineux pour dessiner des figures dans la nuit étoilée. On raconte que ce Pokémon gagne le respect de ses pairs en composant des figures complexes dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Illumise guía en el vuelo a un grupo de iluminados Volbeat para que hagan dibujos en el oscuro cielo. Según dicen, cuanto más complejos sean los dibujos, más le respetan los miembros de su grupo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Illumise leads a flight of illuminated Volbeat to draw signs in the night sky. This Pokémon is said to earn greater respect from its peers by composing more complex designs in the sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"バルビートを 誘導して サインを 描く。 複雑な サインを 描く イルミーゼほど 仲間から 尊敬されると いわれているよ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":314,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor